
Executive Summary
Our analysis reveals that BharatSaver’s APY and Jeevan Utsav calculator pages lack depth and SEO refinement compared to top competitors, causing them to rank below. Competitor APY pages (Groww, Axis, Paytm, Upstox) include extensive definitions, examples, charts, and FAQ sections. Likewise, Jeevan Utsav pages on liccalculators.info and licpremiumcalculator.in provide thorough plan details, feature highlights, and FAQs. By expanding content (e.g. adding scheme details, worked examples, and benefits), structuring it with clear headings, and embedding FAQ schema, BharatSaver can meet user intent more fully. On the technical side, optimizing page speed, ensuring mobile responsiveness, and adding structured data (JSON‑LD FAQ) will improve performance. Backlink profiles must be strengthened – competitors (Groww, Axis) enjoy far higher authority from strong backlinks. We prioritize: (1) On-page content expansion (high impact), (2) Structured data and schema (medium), (3) Technical speed fixes (medium), (4) Title/meta rewrites and internal linking (high), and (5) Link-building (long-term high). Detailed comparisons and a step-by-step action plan follow.

